WEBVTT

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
ashita he tsuzuku sakamichi no tochuu de

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
On the uphill road that leads to tomorrow

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
surechigau otona tachi wa tsubuyaku no sa

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:32.510
We pass by adults who tell us this

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"ai toka yume toka risou mo wakaru kedo

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.640
"I can understand ideals such as love and dreams

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
me no mae no genjitsu wa sonna ni amaku nai" tte

00:00:39.850 --> 00:00:43.810
but the real world isn't as easy as you think"

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
tsumazuki nagara mo korogari nagara mo

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:50.150
Even though we keep tripping and falling

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
kasabuta darake no jyounetsu wo wasuretaku nai

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.360
We have to remember these pains of growing up

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
otona ni narenai bokura no

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.830
For all of us who can't force ourselves to do so yet

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
tsuyogari wo hitotsu kiite kure

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.330
Listen to this one thing I have to say

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
nige mo kakure mo shinai kara

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.540
I won't run or cower away

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
waraitai yatsu dake warae

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:07.460
So whoever wants to laugh at me, go ahead

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
semete tayori nai bokura no

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.250
Since we can't be relied upon yet

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
jiyuu no me wo tsumitoranai de

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.800
Don't take away our seed of freedom

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
mizu wo ageru sono yakume wo

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:15.800
The task of nurturing this plant

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
hataseba iindarou?

00:01:15.880 --> 00:01:18.890
That's all we have to do, right?

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:30.020
{Intro}

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:34.490
I'm... I'm a monster?

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:36.740
How many times do I have
to say it, Kiyomaro?

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.950
I don't want to see your face!

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.920
Oh, you're alone as well?

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:05.930
I'm also... I'm also all alone.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:11.060
That child was sent to the human world.
He is one of the Devil's children.

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.070
A demon, you say?

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:18.320
Will you hand over your red book?

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:21.950
If that woman gets this book,

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.450
Gash will disappear!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.040
As long as you're with that child,

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.540
you'll only be inviting disaster!

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.840
You won't give up the book?

00:02:33.840 --> 00:02:36.840
Then I'll take it, even if it
means tearing your hands off!

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.130
Let me burn it!

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:42.800
Yes, the battle has already begun.

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:45.470
Who the hell are you?

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:47.180
This is Kiyomaro's house!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:50.520
Doruku.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.860
You...

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:03.740
{Part A}

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:12.210
The Black Assassins - Brago and Sherry

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:18.470
Gash!

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:22.180
Another has come.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:23.720
Yes.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:25.970
I just noticed.

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.810
Shall we follow?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:33.690
Well, the fewer of them there are,
the better it is for us.

00:03:34.560 --> 00:03:36.400
For now, let us watch.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.030
You can't... You can't...

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:47.660
But... you were nice to me.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:16.400
Doruku!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.990
Kiyomaro?

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:34.540
What are you doing here, Kiyomaro?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:35.750
What am I...

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.420
You! That thing was attacking you!

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:41.260
That thing is my friend!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:43.340
That should be obvious!

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.640
What? Your friend?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.280
Tell it to sit!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.780
Got it? Tell it to sit!

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.450
You call that a friend?

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.530
It's here.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:11.330
That guy's book.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.830
Renji, I'll burn it.

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.370
Wait.

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:19.340
He hasn't even counterattacked yet.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:23.420
This battle was supposed
to be interesting.

00:05:23.840 --> 00:05:26.090
That's why I accepted the deal.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.390
I was supposed to be able
to finally fight a worthy opponent.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.230
Make this a little more fun for me!

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.230
I can take your book after I beat you.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.690
Opponents will come to fight you.

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:49.240
That guy was telling the truth.
It's the battle to determine the king.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:51.830
Steal the book?

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:56.210
So back then, you...

00:05:57.460 --> 00:05:58.580
I see now.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:06.050
You... You're no friend of mine.

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:09.390
Come on.
Make this interesting for me!

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:10.720
Doruku!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:18.310
Gash, what are you doing?
Quick, run for it!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:23.730
Damn it!

00:06:24.900 --> 00:06:25.940
Zakeru!

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:30.530
Snap out of it!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.280
Gash, what were you doing?

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.410
Shut up!

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:36.040
Kiyomaro, you should
get out of here, too!

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.210
I'm a tool for murder!

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.750
So, just forget about me!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:45.800
But you shot lightning out of
your mouth and bragged about it!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.840
So what?

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:50.260
I'm better than other
people, so isn't that okay?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:55.010
It's too hard being a
monster, so isn't that okay?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:07:01.440
Even though I'm a monster, I still want
to try to remain optimistic, okay?

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:05.570
Even though I'm a monster,
I still want to try my best!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.530
What did I do wrong?

00:07:09.400 --> 00:07:10.610
Damn.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.070
So that's what it was.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:15.450
This guy, suffering like this...

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.250
Suffering all alone...

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.580
But I...

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:22.380
I...

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.130
Dorusen!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.720
What are you taking your time for?

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.810
Just use your lightning once,
and we'll be finished!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.520
Oh cra--

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:44.560
I'll...!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.740
Kiyomaro!

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.950
Kiyomaro, are you okay?

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:59.000
I'm a monster! Why are
you protecting me?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:00.540
Kiyomaro?

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.290
I can't... do anything...

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.880
Kiyomaro! Kiyomaro!

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:11.300
When I was suffering before,
he always helped me.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.130
What's wrong?

00:08:09.130 --> 00:08:12.720
Kiyomaro? Kiyomaro!

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:14.680
But I can't... do anything...

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.350
Already finished?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:23.640
How boring! I thought we'd
get to play a little longer!

00:08:27.480 --> 00:08:28.480
Doruku!

00:08:32.200 --> 00:08:33.200
Indeed.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.320
Let's end their little game.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:38.950
Reisu!

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.820
My... my Gofure!

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:13.320
That... with just one attack?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.660
Gofure!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.460
Leave the book, and get out.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.590
Now it's your turn.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:40.970
Gurabirei.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.100
Right now, you can still move your hands.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:53.990
Before you're crushed from above
by this power, hand over the book.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:56.490
Nev...er...

00:09:57.610 --> 00:09:58.700
I see...

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.000
Kiyomaro! Stop it!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:09.250
Why are you protecting that book?

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:15.420
It's just like last time! Why did you protect
me? No matter how you look at it...

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.050
I'm a monster!

00:10:18.220 --> 00:10:20.510
I shouldn't be here!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:26.390
If I'm here, only bad things will happen
to you and your home!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:32.980
And... And as for me, I
don't have any friends.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.650
The one I had... disappeared.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:40.360
It won't be fun anymore.

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.330
So hurry, let go of the book!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.790
You'll get killed!

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.340
I understand now...

00:10:55.090 --> 00:11:03.100
It was my fault. Don't
say anymore. I'm sorry.

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:07.310
This time... it's my turn.

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:12.690
You've helped me more than enough.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:15.230
I never returned the favor.

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:18.740
Kiyo...

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:21.660
This time...

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:29.120
This time it's my turn
to return Gash's favor!

00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:38.010
{Part B}

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:52.140
This time it's my turn
to return Gash's favor!

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:55.820
Even with this strain on him...

00:11:56.770 --> 00:12:00.070
A human shouldn't be able
to lift even a finger.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:03.990
And yet, he's forcing himself that much.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:08.160
Why? Why isn't he letting go of the book?

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:12.290
Why is he getting up?

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:17.130
Kiyomaro. Kiyomaro!

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.840
Kiyomaro! Stop it already! You'll die!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:24.760
You be quiet, too!

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.390
Gurabirei!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.650
He's still...

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:41.280
You bastards... I don't
know what your problem is.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.910
Compared to you, I don't know much...

00:12:49.290 --> 00:12:56.500
But... for me, there's one important thing!

00:12:58.090 --> 00:13:01.670
Until now, I was the kind
of person who just went home.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:07.930
But thanks to this guy,
I've changed somehow.

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:11.850
Somehow...

00:13:15.350 --> 00:13:17.900
Somehow, I think he was able to save me!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.900
That's why... that's why...

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.320
this time, I'll...

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.580
Reisu!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:48.590
Kiyomaro! Kiyomaro!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.180
Damn...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:59.770
Just stop. It doesn't
matter if you interrupt.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:06.570
You... since you lost your memory,
I'll explain to you before we leave...

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.120
what a failure you are!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.450
How you managed to win
three fights like this...

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:16.580
It's a real mystery.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:22.460
Did you think that a guy
like you could have friends?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.170
You've just lost a friend
in this fight, haven't you?

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:33.970
But of course, I forgot. You're
from the demon world, aren't you?

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:39.900
Shut the hell up!

00:14:46.110 --> 00:14:48.650
Unbelievable... he got up again!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.160
Ki...yo...ma...ro!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.040
Gash!

00:14:57.410 --> 00:15:01.420
You... You're not alone!

00:15:02.170 --> 00:15:04.000
Fight, Gash!

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.970
The purpose of this fight
isn't to decide some king!

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:13.100
It's your destiny!

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.560
Your fight to win happiness!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.310
Fight... fight to exist here!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:23.690
If you really want to find out
anything about yourself,

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:26.480
fight, so you can search for it!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:29.320
And because I'm fighting...

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:34.280
Fight to fight with me!

00:15:36.490 --> 00:15:39.460
You are my friend!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:44.590
It doesn't matter whether you're a demon,
a monster, or whatever! You're my friend!

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:49.380
And it's no problem with me if
you want to fight them, too!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:11.950
He still looks enthusiastic.

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:13.320
Indeed.

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:16.030
I'm through with being nice.

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:19.700
Release the "gurabirei."

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.000
The biggest attack...

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.630
You're going to use that?

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.250
Is that okay, Sherry?

00:16:26.960 --> 00:16:28.840
There's no way he'll survive this.

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:33.180
It just kills anyone else.

00:16:35.720 --> 00:16:37.640
Now, this is the end!

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.030
Giganoreisu!

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:57.370
It's over.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:01.450
That book!

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.210
It's shining like last time.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.420
Impossible. That color!

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.880
- Gash, we're going to fight!
- Yeah!

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:14.380
- Fight!
- Yeah!

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:18.470
- Fight!
- Yeah!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:22.350
Zakeru!

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.650
It's huge! When and where
did that power come from?

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:35.030
Impossible! Impossible!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:39.280
Unbelievable. He nullified it?

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:43.330
A power equal to "giganoreisu?"

00:17:52.300 --> 00:17:54.010
Let... go!

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:57.970
I won't give up my red book.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:04.850
No matter what you guys
say, I won't let it go.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:08.520
No matter what you say...

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:14.280
Like today, I'll beat... you... again...

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:26.790
What an idiot. He should've realized
it would eventually come to this.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.760
Somehow, he was able to save me!

00:18:36.840 --> 00:18:39.430
You are my friend!

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:55.650
Kiyomaro!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.530
Kiyomaro!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:00.240
It's okay. He's not dead.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:04.490
Give him a message for me
when he comes to, okay?

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:08.580
We'll overlook it this time, but next
time, we will definitely take the book.

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:13.170
So until then, guard that book as
if it were precious, and relax.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:18.130
Understand? Even if we were
to lose, we won't stop.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:22.260
Let's meet again, child of the red book.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.480
Why did you let only him go?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:35.730
It's only until we've defeated the others.

00:19:38.860 --> 00:19:40.610
W-What did you want me to say?

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.160
Oh, nothing.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:48.620
Just that for once, you actually look
like you might be happy.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:55.090
Now, Brago, after a little rest,
we'll look for the next book.

00:19:55.090 --> 00:19:56.750
I need no rest.

00:19:56.750 --> 00:19:59.670
You and the rest of the humans tire easily.

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.600
Dear Father,

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:15.360
Thanks to you, we've gotten
into a lot of trouble.

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:19.110
No, it wasn't your fault,

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.740
at least this time.

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:26.580
Rather, it feels like something important
has awoke inside of me.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:30.450
I'm home!

00:20:32.290 --> 00:20:36.710
However, please let me smash
your calm face sometime.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:41.630
K-Kiyomaro! What is all this?
Explain this!

00:20:41.630 --> 00:20:42.970
Well, you see, the thing is...

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:46.510
Did you think you could fool me into
thinking you were a good kid by fixing this?

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:48.890
No, he really is helping.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.770
Gash-chan, silent.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.900
Wait... Kiyomaro?

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.480
Kiyomaro?

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:59.730
I'm looking forward to that day.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:04.610
Strong and bright, together with Gash,
I'll get there, one step at a time.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:05.030
{Ending}

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
ne konna koto tsuzukete itemo

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:20.750
You know, even if we continue to progress like this

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
shiawase wa mitsukaru no kana?

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:25.970
Will we be able to find true happiness?

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
tarinai mono kazoete mitemo

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:31.100
When I try counting what is missing in my life

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
kiri ga nai no wakatteru you

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:36.230
I know the list will keep going on and on

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
shinario douri nante

00:21:36.770 --> 00:21:41.900
Everything goes according to plans

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
umaku iku wake nai kara

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:46.660
Of course that can never happen

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
toki ni wa zenbu

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:49.280
At times, everything that I have

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
nagedashi taku naru

00:21:49.620 --> 00:21:52.120
I just want to let it all go

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
sonna hi ga attemo iiyone

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:57.920
Is it uncommon to have days like this?

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
hito wa mina okubyou dakara

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:05.470
Everyone is afraid, even though we don't show it

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
yume wo miru no kana?

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:10.010
Is that why we dream?

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
hito wa mina kodoku dakara

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:15.850
Everyone feels lonely on the inside

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
ai wo sagasu no kana?

00:22:16.100 --> 00:22:20.360
Is that why we look for love?

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
kitto chigau

00:22:20.860 --> 00:22:23.400
Even though you are not here

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
basho de kimi mo

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:25.780
know that where ever you are

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
onaji tsuki wo

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.950
You are gazing up

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
miteru you ne...

00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:31.620
at the same moon as me...

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:35.080
{Preview}

00:22:38.670 --> 00:22:40.580
Takamine-kun! I came to check on you!

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:42.790
Kiyomaro! The red book is gone!

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:45.300
What? How? But I was sure it
was right on top of the bed!

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:47.930
Takamine-kun! Look what I made for you!

00:22:47.930 --> 00:22:49.340
It's not under the bed, either!

00:22:49.340 --> 00:22:52.100
Nakimushimikan-chan and
Hohoemiyo-chan, they've been...

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:54.770
If it falls into the wrong hands,
Gash will disappear!

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:56.680
It's very emotional!

00:22:56.680 --> 00:23:00.100
Next time, on Konjiki no Gash Bell:
The Lost Red Spell Book.

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:02.810
Don't lose, Suzume!

00:23:01.560 --> 00:23:04.980
The Lost Red Spell Book
